    "endingForgiveness": "The last optical decision is made while standing on the safe floor below-left of the original mirror. The western shelf provides a stationary relaunch above that reflected beam. The lower one-way step before the King is sheltered from his floor wave, so the player can wait and retry the approach. The saved final attacks succeed at the canonical timing and thirty/eighty frames later; actual yield turns off the beams and opens a full-height sealed lower departure, with no timed finishing jump.",
